<TITLE>7.2.6.3. Tolerance intervals for a normal distribution</TITLE>
</HEAD>

<BODY BGCOLOR="FFFFCC">

<IMG SRC="../../gifs/nvgtbr.gif" BORDER=0 VALIGN="TOP" ISMAP USEMAP="#MenuBar">
<map name="MenuBar">
